name    mod-dungeon-challenge: a full boss clear of Turtle Stormwind Vault (35) completes the run
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Stormwind Vault is staged `enabled = 0` in dungeon_challenge_dungeons with
# boss_count 6; this checks the boss list (dungeon_challenge_boss_entry plus rank 3) before it is enabled: the
# director kills every listed boss with `.die` in a level-1 run (uplift 80); the run must end cleared, with every kill
# credited. `.dchallenge start` only knows enabled dungeons: the test window sets `enabled = 1` and restarts, and a
# dungeon whose scenario fails goes back to `enabled = 0`.
timeout 300s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
as gm .cheat god on
as gm .dchallenge start 35 1
expect output has "starting"
waitfor gm map 35 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log boss 1 - bride (930073)
do gm goto 73 116.2 -39.1
wait 2s
pick bride creature:930073 near gm
require bride exists
do gm target bride
as gm .die
waitfor bride dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 2 - volkan (930074)
do gm goto -12.6 52.2 -38.1
wait 2s
pick volkan creature:930074 near gm
require volkan exists
do gm target volkan
as gm .die
waitfor volkan dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 3 - tham (930075)
do gm goto -131.3 71.3 -30.6
wait 2s
pick tham creature:930075 near gm
require tham exists
do gm target tham
as gm .die
waitfor tham dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 4 - aszosh (930076)
do gm goto -1.4 191.1 -26.6
wait 2s
pick aszosh creature:930076 near gm
require aszosh exists
do gm target aszosh
as gm .die
waitfor aszosh dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 5 - damian (930077)
do gm goto -12.7 150.2 -39.4
wait 2s
pick damian creature:930077 near gm
require damian exists
do gm target damian
as gm .die
waitfor damian dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 6 - arc (930080)
do gm goto -100.1 150.5 -39.4
wait 2s
pick arc creature:930080 near gm
require arc exists
do gm target arc
as gm .die
waitfor arc dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log the run ended cleared with every boss credited
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "bosses 6/6"
expect output has "state 7"

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
